Subject: forest birds: multi-transect multi-year distance sampling data, 'stacked' data and pseudoreplication
Message-ID: <BQRlicH1bEg.h79m2793AgAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/BQRlicH1bEg/m/h79m2793AgAJ>
